---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const structuredData = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Product",
  "name": "Caterham Penske 7500 CODA Suspension Kit",
  "description": "Penske 7500 CODA double-adjustable coilover suspension kit for the Caterham Seven — S3, SV and CSR chassis. Independent compression and rebound adjustment, sweep or clicker adjuster. Front digressive/linear and rear linear pistons, built on Simon Rogers' championship-winning valving. Supplied with Eibach springs and mounting spacers.",
  "brand": {
    "@type": "Brand",
    "name": "Penske Racing Shocks"
  },
  "category": "Coilover Suspension Kit",
  "image": "https://toofasttorace.com/images/Penske.png",
  "url": "https://toofasttorace.com/caterham/penske-7500-coda",
  "offers": {
    "@type": "Offer",
    "url": "https://toofasttorace.com/caterham/penske-7500-coda",
    "priceCurrency": "GBP",
    "price": "3758.00",
    "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock",
    "seller": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Too Fast To Race"
    }
  }
};
---

<Layout title="Caterham Penske 7500 CODA Suspension Kit | S3 SV CSR | Too Fast To Race" description="Penske 7500 CODA double-adjustable coilover suspension kit for the Caterham Seven — S3, SV and CSR. Independent compression and rebound, sweep or clicker adjuster. From £3,758 +VAT. Eibach springs, mounting spacers and Simon Rogers' championship-winning valving. Bespoke specification from Too Fast To Race.">
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(structuredData)} />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="stripe-accent"></span>
      <h1>Caterham Penske <span class="text-green">7500 CODA</span></h1>
      <div class="hero-intro">
        <div class="brand-logo-chip">
          <img src="/images/Penske.png" alt="Penske 7500 CODA suspension for Caterham — Penske Racing Shocks" class="brand-logo" width="160" height="64" />
        </div>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">The double-adjustable 7500 — independent control of compression and rebound, without a remote reservoir. Penske build quality and developable specification for the Caterham driver who adjusts with a purpose.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Summary / Price -->
  <section class="kit-summary-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="kit-summary">
        <div class="kit-price">
          <span class="price-label">From</span>
          <span class="price-figure">£3,758</span>
          <span class="price-note">+ VAT &amp; shipping · clicker from £4,002</span>
        </div>
        <div class="kit-specs">
          <div class="spec">
            <span class="spec-label">Damper</span>
            <span class="spec-value">Penske 7500 CODA</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec">
            <span class="spec-label">Adjustment</span>
            <span class="spec-value">Comp &amp; Rebound</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec">
            <span class="spec-label">Springs</span>
            <span class="spec-value">Eibach (Hyperco optional)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec">
            <span class="spec-label">Chassis</span>
            <span class="spec-value">S3 · SV · CSR</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Enquire About This Kit</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What It Is -->
  <section class="kit-content">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="showcase-grid">
        <div class="showcase-image">
          <img src="/images/7500.png" alt="Penske 7500 CODA double-adjustable coilover damper for Caterham Seven — S3, SV and CSR" width="800" height="900" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="content-block showcase-text">
          <h2>Independent Compression and <span class="text-green">Rebound</span></h2>
          <p>The 7500 CODA takes the same Penske 7500 platform as the COSA and adds a second external adjuster, so compression and rebound damping can be set independently. Each direction of movement is a different event with different demands — and the CODA lets you tune one without disturbing the other, all without the complexity or packaging of a remote reservoir.</p>
          <p>As with every Penske kit we supply, the CODA is built on Simon Rogers' championship-winning valving, proven in real Caterham competition. The front dampers run digressive/linear pistons and the rear run a linear piston — the same deliberate configuration developed for how the Seven loads each axle, now with the freedom to refine compression and rebound separately as the car evolves.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block">
        <h2>Sweep or Clicker <span class="text-green">Adjuster</span></h2>
        <p>Like the COSA, the 7500 CODA is offered with two rebound adjuster styles. The standard <strong>sweep adjuster</strong> — the type shown in the images — is set with a pin tool and is the robust, proven choice, from <strong>£3,758</strong>. The <strong>clicker eyelet</strong> gives quicker, more repeatable adjustment by hand and is the option many competition drivers prefer, from <strong>£4,002</strong>. The kit is otherwise identical — the choice is purely the adjuster. Both prices are +VAT and shipping.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block">
        <h2>Who the 7500 CODA is <span class="text-green">For</span></h2>
        <p>This is the kit for the Caterham driver who has a process — adjusting compression and rebound against chassis behaviour they can identify, across <a href="/track-day-suspension">track day</a>, club racing and <a href="/hillclimb-suspension">hillclimb</a> use, and who values Penske's rebuildability for long-term development.</p>
        <p>If you want genuine separate adjustment but a simpler ownership step, the single-adjustable <a href="/caterham/penske-7500-cosa">7500 COSA</a> sits below this; if you need true high- and low-speed compression control with a remote canister, the triple-adjustable <a href="/caterham/penske-8700-3-way">8700 3-way</a> is the next step up. And for many road and lighter track Caterhams a <a href="/caterham/nitron-ntr-r3">Nitron NTR R3</a> offers independent adjustment for considerably less — we will give you an honest comparison. More on the brand on the <a href="/penske-racing-shocks">Penske Racing Shocks</a> page.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Included / Options -->
      <div class="included-grid">
        <div class="included-col">
          <h3>What's Included</h3>
          <ul class="kit-list">
            <li>Four-corner Penske 7500 CODA double-adjustable coilover kit</li>
            <li>Eibach springs</li>
            <li>Mounting spacers</li>
            <li>Simon Rogers' championship-winning valving — front digressive/linear, rear linear</li>
            <li>Specified for your chassis, tyres and application</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="included-col">
          <h3>Options</h3>
          <ul class="kit-list">
            <li>Clicker eyelet adjuster in place of the standard sweep adjuster (from £4,002)</li>
            <li>Hyperco springs in place of the standard Eibach springs</li>
            <li>Hydraulic spring perches for quick ride-height adjustment</li>
            <li>Torrington bearings to reduce friction during ride-height adjustment</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block">
        <h2>Caterham <span class="text-green">Fitment</span></h2>
        <p>This kit is specified for the Caterham Seven across the S3, SV and CSR chassis. The price is the same for each — the specification work behind it is what adapts the kit to your particular car. If you are unsure which chassis you have or how your car is used, tell us and we will guide you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Related -->
  <section class="related-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="stripe-accent"></span>
        <h2>Related Expertise</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="related-grid">
        <a href="/caterham/penske-7500-cosa" class="related-card">
          <h3>Penske 7500 COSA</h3>
          <p>Single-adjustable — the entry point to Penske ownership for the Caterham Seven.</p>
          <span class="related-link">View the COSA →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/caterham/penske-8700-3-way" class="related-card">
          <h3>Penske 8700 3-Way</h3>
          <p>Triple-adjustable with remote canister — the top of the Caterham Penske range.</p>
          <span class="related-link">View the 8700 →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/penske-racing-shocks" class="related-card">
          <h3>Penske Racing Shocks</h3>
          <p>Why Penske is the benchmark in motorsport — and when it is and isn't the right answer.</p>
          <span class="related-link">Penske →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/caterham/nitron-ntr-r3" class="related-card">
          <h3>Nitron NTR R3 40mm</h3>
          <p>Independent compression and rebound from Nitron — strong value for many Caterham programmes.</p>
          <span class="related-link">View the R3 →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/caterham/suspension" class="related-card">
          <h3>Caterham Suspension Kits</h3>
          <p>The full range of Caterham coilover kits — Nitron and Penske — in one place.</p>
          <span class="related-link">All Kits →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/hillclimb-suspension" class="related-card">
          <h3>Hillclimb Suspension</h3>
          <p>What sprint and hillclimb use demands, and why adjustability only helps with a process.</p>
          <span class="related-link">Hillclimb →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-content">
        <h2>Specify Your 7500 CODA Kit</h2>
        <p>Tell us about your Caterham, your programme and how you develop the car. We will specify a 7500 CODA kit built on proven valving — and tell you honestly if a COSA or a Nitron system suits you better.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Start Your Specification</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* Page Hero */
  .page-hero {
    padding: calc(80px + var(--space-xl)) 0 var(--space-lg);
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(92, 184, 92, 0.2);
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    max-width: 65ch;
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-intro {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .hero-intro .hero-subtitle {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .brand-logo-chip {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background: var(--tftr-white);
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .brand-logo {
    height: 100%;
    width: auto;
    max-height: 96px;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero-intro {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .brand-logo {
      height: 44px;
    }
  }

  /* Summary / Price */
  .kit-summary-section {
    background: var(--tftr-black);
    padding: var(--space-lg) 0;
  }

  .kit-summary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
    border: 1px solid rgba(92, 184, 92, 0.2);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--tftr-green);
    padding: var(--space-md);
  }

  .kit-price {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .price-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--tftr-grey);
  }

  .price-figure {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 3rem;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .price-note {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--tftr-grey);
  }

  .kit-specs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .spec {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .spec-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--tftr-grey);
  }

  .spec-value {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--tftr-white);
  }

  /* Content */
  .kit-content {
    background: var(--tftr-black);
  }

  .content-block {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .content-block h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .content-block p {
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .included-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .included-col {
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border-top: 2px solid var(--tftr-green);
  }

  .included-col h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .kit-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .kit-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .kit-list li::before {
    content: '→';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
  }

  /* Related */
  .related-section {
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .related-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .related-card {
    background: var(--tftr-dark);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .related-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(92, 184, 92, 0.3);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .related-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    color: var(--tftr-white);
  }

  .related-card p {
    color: var(--tftr-grey-light);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    flex-grow: 1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .related-link {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--tftr-green);
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--tftr-green-dark), var(--tftr-green));
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-content h2 {
    color: var(--tftr-black);
  }

  .cta-content p {
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: var(--space-sm) auto var(--space-md);
    max-width: 55ch;
  }

  .cta-content .btn-primary {
    background: var(--tftr-black);
    color: var(--tftr-white);
  }

  .cta-content .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--tftr-darker);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .kit-summary {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }

    .kit-specs {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .related-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  /* Product Showcase */
  .showcase-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .showcase-image {
    background: var(--tftr-white);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: var(--space-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .showcase-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 460px;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  .showcase-text {
    margin-bottom: 0 !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .showcase-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
  }
</style>